    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Menyirok ma thol ma kipima",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atiŋo waŋan malo t'aŋiyo, aka neni, jacwo m'otiŋo thol ma kipima i cinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo apenjo go ni, “Ikadho kune?” Go odwokan ni, “Akadho kipima Yerusalem ŋeyo dwoŋo mere kodi boro mere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka neni, malaika m'oyido luwo kodan obino malo, aka malaika man owok romo gi go, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka owaco rigo ni, “Ŋweci, iluw gi jayac no, aka iwaci ni, ‘Yerusalem ladoŋ paka adec m'othangere, ro ji kodi ogwaŋe ma jonitie i iye.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole An, Rwoth awaco ni alabedo rigo cel ma kor ot thoko, aka alabedo dwoŋ i go.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilwoŋo jotwec dok peco",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awi, awi, ringi woko i lowo ma yumalo, Rwoth waco, kole paka koyin aŋwen ma polo, atieko kedhin woko, Rwoth waco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awi, awi, Zayon kwale, in m'ibedo gi nyar Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Rwoth pa lwak jolweny waco ama; ri dwoŋ ma go ooran bongi nonin ma jonyaga win, kole ŋat'ogeyin, meno ogeyo tongi waŋan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ee acegin yengo cingan kwoŋ jo, aka ŋecin pajo jolakinyaga jo, aka wilaŋeyo nike Rwoth pa lwak jolweny ooran.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koki ri kisangala aka fore, Awi nyar Zayon, kole neni, ee acegin bino aka alabedo i dier in, Rwoth waco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonin kweth jolariwere gi Rwoth i ndelo no, aka jolabedo ji paran, aka alabedo i dier in, aka ilaŋeyo nike Rwoth pa lwak jolweny ooran bongin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth lalunjo Yuda paka adec pere i lowo maleŋ, aka go layero Yerusalem kendo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudere, win ji je, ruwaŋ Rwoth, kole go oay wok i kabedo pere maleŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
